  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start the process, we first prioritize orders based on when they were received."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "Then, we proceed to check the customer's information."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If the customer exists, we move on to checking their payment history."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "On the other hand, if the customer does not exist, we need to verify their customer status."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the payment history is good, we can continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "However, if the customer is a private customer, we send them a declining message."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "In the case of a wholesaler, we create a new customer and check for product availability."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "If the products are not available, we produce the missing goods and send a decline message, thus ending the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "If the products are available, we continue with the process and send an order confirmation."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "Simultaneously, we inform the stock and accounting departments."
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "After packing the goods and writing the invoice, the goods are ready for delivery and the invoice is sent."
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "Once the order is closed, we deliver the goods and invoice to the customer."
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "content": "If payment has been received, we close the order."
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "content": "However, if there is an outstanding payment, we check the quantity of reminders."
    },
    {
      "id": "i15",
      "content": "If there are less than three reminders, we continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i16",
      "content": "On the other hand, if there are more than three reminders, we activate the donning process, thus ending the process."
    }
  ]
}